{"seq":2,"slug":"monorepo-engineering","title":"Monorepo 工程实践","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# Monorepo 工程实践 简介\n\nMonorepo 是将多个项目、多个包统一放置在同一个版本控制仓库中的代码组织策略。它并非新概念——Google、Meta、Microsoft 等科技巨头早已在数十亿行代码的规模上实践这一模式。近年来，随着 Turborepo、Nx、pnpm workspace 等工具的成熟，Monorepo 从大厂专属方案变成了中小团队也能轻松采用的主流工程实践。然而，\"把代码放到一起\"只是起点，真正的挑战在于如何构建高效的任务编排、依赖管理、构建缓存、测试策略和发布流程。\n\n本手册面向有一定前端或全栈开发经验、正在或即将采用 Monorepo 架构的工程师。无论你是从多仓迁移到单仓，还是从零搭建新的 Monorepo 项目，这里都能为你提供从基础概念到规模化落地的系统性指导。\n\n第一章**基础概念**从 Monorepo 的核心理念出发，对比单仓与多仓的优劣势，深入 Workspace 协议的工作机制，梳理内部依赖管理的策略，并建立清晰的项目分层结构。这些基础决策将直接影响后续所有工程化实践的效率。\n\n第二章**构建与任务**聚焦于 Monorepo 中最关键的工程效率问题。Turborepo、Nx 等工具如何利用依赖图进行智能任务编排，本地与远程缓存如何将构建时间缩短数倍，增量构建和并行执行如何榨干每一分计算资源——这些能力决定了 Monorepo 能否在规模增长后依然保持敏捷。\n\n第三章**共享包设计**深入 Monorepo 最核心的价值——代码复用。包的设计原则、版本管理策略、类型共享机制和发布工作流，共同构成了高质量共享包体系的四大支柱。好的包设计让复用自然发生，坏的包设计让依赖变成噩梦。\n\n第四章**测试与质量**建立 Monorepo 场景下的质量保障体系。单元测试、集成测试和端到端测试如何在多包架构中合理分层，ESLint 和 Biome 的共享配置如何保证代码风格一致，CI 流水线如何只运行受影响的检查，以及依赖图分析如何预防架构腐化。\n\n第五章**迁移与规模化**面向实际落地的关键挑战。从多仓迁移的具体策略与历史保留，IDE 和 Git 在大仓库下的性能优化，代码生成与脚手架工具的自动化，以及不同场景下的 Monorepo 架构案例——让理论真正转化为可执行的工程决策。\n\nMonorepo 不是银弹，但当你的项目涉及多个应用、多个共享库、多人协作时，它所带来的代码复用、原子提交、统一工具链和简化依赖管理等优势，往往能显著提升团队的工程效率和交付质量。本手册的目标是帮助你在正确的时机、以正确的方式采用 Monorepo，并在规模增长中持续收获其红利。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础概念","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monorepo-overview","title":"Monorepo 概述","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/monorepo-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"workspace-protocols","title":"Workspace 协议","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/workspace-protocols"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-management","title":"依赖管理","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/dependency-management"},{"seq":4,"slug":"project-structure","title":"项目结构","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/project-structure"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-and-task","title":"构建与任务","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"task-orchestration","title":"任务编排","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/task-orchestration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"caching-strategies","title":"缓存策略","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/caching-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incremental-builds","title":"增量构建","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/incremental-builds"},{"seq":4,"slug":"parallel-execution","title":"并行执行","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/parallel-execution"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-packages","title":"共享包设计","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"package-design","title":"包设计原则","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/package-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"versioning-strategy","title":"版本策略","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/versioning-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"type-sharing","title":"类型共享","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/type-sharing"},{"seq":4,"slug":"publishing-workflow","title":"发布工作流","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/publishing-workflow"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-and-quality","title":"测试与质量","docCount":4,"url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-strategy","title":"测试策略","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/testing-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-quality-tools","title":"代码质量工具","url":"/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/code-quality-tools"},{"seq":3,"slu